If this is the case, then I guess I'll let you have him.

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:36.550
Why would we ever happen?

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:40.540
That busty neighbor girl will take him if you don't.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:42.430
And why should I care?

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.520
Geez, be true to your feelings.

00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:46.640
Maybe <i>you</i> should get hypnotized.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:54.990
We're here.

00:18:54.990 --> 00:18:55.740
Yeah.

00:18:57.810 --> 00:18:59.030
See you.

00:18:59.390 --> 00:19:00.290
Yeah.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.320
Mitsuki?

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:08.990
Sorry for doing all that dirty stuff.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:11.760
It's fine, forget it.

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:17.210
I'm already dead, and this time I'll be gone for good.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:19.670
But it's been fun knowing you, Mitsuki.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:28.030
Be sure to tell Onii-chan that
there was a girl who loved him.

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:34.850
If I ever become reincarnated, I'd love to return as you and Onii-chan's love child.

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:36.690
Idiot!

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:45.030
Goodbye, Mitsuki.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:46.660
I'll see you.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:22.330
Sorry for all the trouble I caused yesterday.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:25.160
I don't remember much thanks to my fever.

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:29.550
Though I think I made Yuki-nee angry...

00:20:30.400 --> 00:20:33.170
I'll be heading off, Onii-chan.

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:58.840
You and that T.S.T. were nothing but trouble.

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:04.930
Now everything's back to normal.

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:08.350
Yes... normal.

00:22:19.450 --> 00:22:20.770
Mitsuki...

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:22.300
No way.

00:22:22.300 --> 00:22:25.170
But why... how?

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:28.490
I can't go to Heaven and leave you behind, can I?

00:22:28.790 --> 00:22:30.700
Hiyori...

00:22:30.700 --> 00:22:32.340
Yeah, you wish!

00:22:32.340 --> 00:22:33.110
Huh?

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:41.250
The Interstice of Time?

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:43.470
Why are we here <i>again?</i>

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:44.780
Walk through it.

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:47.670
But won't that kill me?

00:22:47.670 --> 00:22:48.970
It'll be fine!

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:49.630
No! Stop, I don't want to die!

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:52.010
Come on! Get a move on!
No! Stop, I don't want to die!

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:54.720
God, no!

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:02.810
Where are we? In Heaven?

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:04.590
Look at that.

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:12.740
This is the second floor.

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:14.100
The second floor...?

00:23:15.770 --> 00:23:18.620
So, um... there you have it.

00:23:18.620 --> 00:23:21.330
I need you a little longer. There!

00:23:23.160 --> 00:23:24.360
It's cool.

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:28.800
I had them make it 30 percent more sensitive this time, so it'll be over before you know it.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:32.490
Let's continue enjoying our thrills together, Mitsuki!

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:36.590
This can't be happening!
